      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Headings: <h1> → <h6>\n<p> paragraph\n<br> line break     <hr> horizontal rule\n<b> bold           <i> italic\n<u> underline      <mark> highlight\n<del> strike       <sup> x²\n<sub> H₂O\n\nSEO reminder: normally keep one main <h1> for the page topic.\n\nLorem Ipsum = placeholder text.\nIn VS Code: type lorem + Tab.\nlorem10 / lorem50 / lorem100 → control word count.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Headings: <h1> → <h6>\n<p> paragraph\n<br> line break     <hr> horizontal rule\n<b> bold           <i> italic\n<u> underline      <mark> highlight\n<del> strike       <sup> x²\n<sub> H₂O\n\nSEO reminder: normally keep one main <h1> for the page topic.\n\nLorem Ipsum = placeholder text.\nIn VS Code: type lorem + Tab.\nlorem10 / lorem50 / lorem100 → control word count.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
