      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "QUICK MEMORY\n<h1>–<h6> = hierarchy\n<p> = paragraph\n<br> = break\n<hr> = divider\n\nsup = above\nsub = below",
